{"title":"2016 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<pre>Fearsome Foursome\n</pre>\n<p>Factorial Find the complete prime factorization of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/d/81d2243ac2b439b665044d8a0b1ebc5273ca6c50.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{(4!)!}{[(3!)!]^4}\\]\" width=\"51\" height=\"43\" />\n(The answer will be a product of powers of eight distinct primes.)\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/a/f2abc183b2bd749ccfb6a78af06a4a505de10f0e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{2^6*3^2*7^3*11^2*13*17*19*23}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"280\" height=\"26\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_UNCO_Math_Contest_II\" title=\"2016 UNCO Math Contest II\">2016 UNCO Math Contest II</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems\" title=\"2016 UNCO Math Contest II Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Answer_Key\" title=\"2016 UNCO Math Contest II Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://uncmathcontest.wordpress.com/\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2016 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2016 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2016 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2016 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2016 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2016 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2016 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2016 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_UNCO_M